#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059484 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "79841c0d-e191-566b-8fe2-63828dcfc23a" :question/math-academy-id "e-4439" :question/problem "Calculate the minor of the entry $b_{21}$ in the matrix\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}10 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 8 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The minor of $b_{21} = 3$ (second row, first column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $3$ are removed: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 7 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of $b_{21}=3$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot 2-5\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =2-35 \\\\  & =-33.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059485 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Variable Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "51f60726-3d12-507e-b942-5d316fc28bd0" :question/math-academy-id "e-4440" :question/problem "What is the minor of $c_{22}$ in the matrix\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7x & 0 & -3y \\\\ 1 & x+2y & 4 \\\\ -y & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and second column: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7x & ∗ & -3y \\\\ ∗ & x+2y & ∗ \\\\ -y & ∗ & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7x\\cdot 5-(-3y)\\cdot (-y) \\\\  & =35x-3{y}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059486 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown Given the Value of a Minor"}] :question/id #uuid "afd06762-0a78-5559-b035-98bd05e6c084" :question/math-academy-id "e-4441" :question/problem "Given that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5,$ find all the possible values of $k$ in the matrix\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and third column:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of $a_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =k\\cdot 2k-3\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =2{k}^{2}+3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5,$ so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{k}^{2}+3 & =5 \\\\ 2{k}^{2} & =2 \\\\ {k}^{2} & =1 \\\\ k & =\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=-1$ and $k=1.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059909 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9b8dae13-1e66-58f8-b581-5c2ac45be0b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056174} {:answer/id #uuid "e9e20322-3350-54d5-929d-74622c12ccee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056175} {:answer/id #uuid "fee430d4-4b07-546d-bcff-cb45c8472080" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056176} {:answer/id #uuid "25c301ea-a4d0-5a45-86f3-0ea8cb2f36f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056177} {:answer/id #uuid "5eb4e718-8728-581d-af53-e8e33fb35ba1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056178}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fee430d4-4b07-546d-bcff-cb45c8472080" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056176} :answer-field/id #uuid "06c73fc1-f230-5ee6-9a1c-b41422b6f78c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056173}] :question/id #uuid "367551dc-32de-5040-981b-1232c513fd73" :question/math-academy-id "q-1094" :question/problem "Calculate the minor of the entry $y_{13}$ in the matrix\n\n$Y = \\begin{bmatrix}15 & 8 & 9 \\\\ 7 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298263 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c918cc98-ace1-52d2-9066-6b346444ab0a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298265} {:answer/id #uuid "372d7438-e6f3-5617-abdc-618e851981f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298266} {:answer/id #uuid "b540fe3f-51a0-5475-9c53-5cb3f0d93706" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "33" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298267} {:answer/id #uuid "fb5f8118-57ac-5cd0-b1e3-90e225df0c5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298268} {:answer/id #uuid "2213e1a4-c597-5325-8da3-8cd00b99758c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "45" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298269}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2213e1a4-c597-5325-8da3-8cd00b99758c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "45" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298269} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c387737-99de-5940-94d1-0f499584da1e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298264}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4fdb2b2f-4f29-5f8d-80c7-aedf558eadfc" :question/math-academy-id "q-127699" :question/problem "Calculate the minor of the entry ${p}_{31}$ in the matrix\n$P=[\\begin{aligned}-11 & 7 & -9 \\\\ 2 & -2 & 9 \\\\ 8 & -5 & 72\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "The minor of ${p}_{31}=8$ (third row, first column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $8$ are removed: \n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 7 & -9 \\\\ ∗ & -2 & 9 \\\\ 8 & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${p}_{31}=8$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}7 & -9 \\\\ -2 & 9\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}7 & -9 \\\\ -2 & 9\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7\\cdot 9-(-9)\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =63-18 \\\\  & =45.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298283 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Variable Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fe51f681-4cec-5e9f-bede-fa871db0e0bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3pr-{r}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298285} {:answer/id #uuid "f3cd295b-4fed-5adc-897a-a71f06f52553" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6qr-p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298286} {:answer/id #uuid "b05169d7-fb45-5e04-9f2c-ead03ca17e6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36pq" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298287} {:answer/id #uuid "3551efc8-ecf9-59b4-baf9-21a2202187a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298288} {:answer/id #uuid "dd2cfc91-9471-5e2f-8551-8ce7e8b6d1fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5pq+6r" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298289}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b05169d7-fb45-5e04-9f2c-ead03ca17e6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36pq" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298287} :answer-field/id #uuid "c8c45f40-f1d2-5ffe-ac46-e6a4a82771f5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298284}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "841cf7a3-361e-5d84-b9d9-a3fbecbeaf00" :question/math-academy-id "q-128024" :question/problem "What is the minor of ${t}_{22}$ in the matrix\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}3p & r & 3p \\\\ q & r & -q \\\\ -6q & -p & 6q\\end{aligned}]?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and the second column:\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}3p & ∗ & 3p \\\\ ∗ & r & ∗ \\\\ -6q & ∗ & 6q\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}3p & 3p \\\\ -6q & 6q\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3p & 3p \\\\ -6q & 6q\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3p\\cdot 6q-3p\\cdot (-6q) \\\\  & =18pq+18pq \\\\  & =36pq\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060063 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown Given the Value of a Minor"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "922efb98-094c-5cb0-b598-ca53dbd40c79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$t = 4$ and $t = 5$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057106} {:answer/id #uuid "cc82bc67-8e72-5ecb-9f14-69a51bf471c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$t = 5$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057107} {:answer/id #uuid "08522422-373c-50b5-8818-1a41c69958ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$t =-5$ and $t = 4$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057108} {:answer/id #uuid "3edcdacf-1a99-5d1f-8af8-bf61ed390ede" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$t =-5$ and $t =-4$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057109} {:answer/id #uuid "78eb832a-251e-55b3-